    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Mary Turquoise",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103936761470959006325/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUMOpeCQNO8pCCHE9Srb4I6NmdF4nxZwcDhHy5SmVXb74UXhlLh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Absolutely love the first 3 towers located near the gym! We have been here for 8 years and we love our condo! The building is very clean, quiet and well insulated. It feels like a private resort with direct access to all amenities from underground (gym, pool, and community room). Made with concrete.\n\nThe property has recently added a small playground for children!\n\nVery quiet, and friendly area, community that quickly becomes your second family once you meet some incredible people.\nPs... If you have a dog, your fur baby will make friends very quickly!",
        "time": 1677945158,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Christopher Langan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104087774040823494530/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUB1-2db3WfO2wOSwgVlLt481J-PXO2E5O_L_NjolKmJL8Ysve-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "The workmanship is not very good at all.  Poor tile work.  Joints and paint are spotty at best. Vanities in bathroom lacking solid instal.  Patio door leaks water when it rains.  List goes on...\n\nSeems there is a big rush to deliver meaning not enough time to do things right.  However, There is going to have to be time made to do things over.",
        "time": 1574548291,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ford Ferguson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104056820730756374653/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHAPgUo8mWdcVgm9-rI1LPfrKHIQsqaWxgniYX-plynNv0vo6AXg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "9 years ago",
        "text": "PROS: Nice and modern location. Tons of amenities and very close to a variety of amazing stores, outlets and gyms. Next to the train station.\nCONS: Lots of people who complain, nag, nitpick and judge. Not much privavcy as a lot of nosey people live here. Very pompous and always having to call the handy man to repair poor workmanship.",
        "time": 1479934974,
        "translated": false
      },
